{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Please note! This is a<strong>\u00a0DEMO</strong>\u00a0version of the game! As such it is very work in progress!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is essentially a small playground to walk around in and play with a few systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The finished product is subject to much change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8eda2d1518108ddc47f16c2a23bc744f.poster.avif?t=1762810561\" width=518 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8eda2d1518108ddc47f16c2a23bc744f.webm?t=1762810561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8eda2d1518108ddc47f16c2a23bc744f.mp4?t=1762810561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orava</strong> is a single player point and click style adventure game where you play as a squirrel looking for their nut. They have lost it you see, and they are in dire need of a snack. Help them get it back!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your way in the forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a whimsical 2.5D world with 3D characters and elements with 2D hand painted backgrounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and collect items</strong> in the world that can be used in various places to further your search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles</strong> using your ingenuity and items your find along the way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save your progress</strong> at mysterious rocks where you recall your past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander</strong> <strong>the mysterious forest</strong> that you call home and ask strange creatures if they have seen your nut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe they have?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Or maybe they have no idea what you are talking about...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8d27ff6502effe7ff48307dbf4677a7c.poster.avif?t=1762810561\" width=304 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8d27ff6502effe7ff48307dbf4677a7c.webm?t=1762810561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8d27ff6502effe7ff48307dbf4677a7c.mp4?t=1762810561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move around and interact with many things in the woods in Orava! You can either...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAB - pick up items and place them in your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TALK - engage in cerebral dialogue with animate and inanimate subjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USE - interact with the object using a specific item in your inventory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment and see what you can do!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the dark corners of the trees frighten you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you feel the eyes of a stranger on the back of your neck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short demo adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullscreen support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, talk to animals, explore the forest !</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138240?t=1762810561","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138240?t=1762810561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/8136adf9c05a19c58042d8f3ba226a81854c6f7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762810561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/8136adf9c05a19c58042d8f3ba226a81854c6f7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762810561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Please note! This is a<strong>\u00a0DEMO</strong>\u00a0version of the game! As such it is very work in progress!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is essentially a small playground to walk around in and play with a few systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The finished product is subject to much change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8eda2d1518108ddc47f16c2a23bc744f.poster.avif?t=1762810561\" width=518 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8eda2d1518108ddc47f16c2a23bc744f.webm?t=1762810561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8eda2d1518108ddc47f16c2a23bc744f.mp4?t=1762810561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orava</strong> is a single player point and click style adventure game where you play as a squirrel looking for their nut. They have lost it you see, and they are in dire need of a snack. Help them get it back!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your way in the forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a whimsical 2.5D world with 3D characters and elements with 2D hand painted backgrounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and collect items</strong> in the world that can be used in various places to further your search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles</strong> using your ingenuity and items your find along the way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save your progress</strong> at mysterious rocks where you recall your past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander</strong> <strong>the mysterious forest</strong> that you call home and ask strange creatures if they have seen your nut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe they have?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Or maybe they have no idea what you are talking about...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8d27ff6502effe7ff48307dbf4677a7c.poster.avif?t=1762810561\" width=304 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8d27ff6502effe7ff48307dbf4677a7c.webm?t=1762810561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/extras/8d27ff6502effe7ff48307dbf4677a7c.mp4?t=1762810561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move around and interact with many things in the woods in Orava! You can either...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAB - pick up items and place them in your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TALK - engage in cerebral dialogue with animate and inanimate subjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USE - interact with the object using a specific item in your inventory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment and see what you can do!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the dark corners of the trees frighten you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you feel the eyes of a stranger on the back of your neck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short demo adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullscreen support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, talk to animals, explore the forest !</p>","developers":["LoLoimu"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4130170","name":"Orava"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138240/6155d7c3480bf812e5741ab2a06baed934b4d19c/header.jpg?t=1762810561","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138240/693696792/ff91a6aae58f09f82c2bb5b8ea48ce83195d4ad7/1761567422/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762810559","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138240/693696792/ff91a6aae58f09f82c2bb5b8ea48ce83195d4ad7/1761567422/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762810559","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138240/693696792/ff91a6aae58f09f82c2bb5b8ea48ce83195d4ad7/1761567422/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762810559","id":257223103,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223103/movie480.mp4?t=1762810559","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223103/movie_max.mp4?t=1762810559"},"name":"Orava_DemoTrailer","thumbnail":"https